{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SiGYBFkBVCktzTABiN3tWQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:53.154948+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SiGYBFkBVCktzTABiN3tWQ","html":"<div><section><section><br/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nSouvwzwDZPSjPnaFx0UuvjnDhXZOdWxQuribZ7c1HGpUuV3vypDC3vg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/><br/></section><section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nP5QV0YnlJ5vf3QSQXlD4JrXMxLJkRsF8oqg4hcME4F9x5vRZIdqu5g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p>发现中国唯一提供完整美国法教育（JD）的法学院</p><p>探索全球唯一将美国职业法学教育（JD）和</p><p>中国法律硕士（JM）教育深度融合的地方</p><p>走进我国培育涉外法律人才的先锋和摇篮</p></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nOU6HOgJlvM216qWx1IEXCGdydwpm7C2mHbm3M2iceAzu2EPN1WnpajA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p>想了解这所独具特色的法学院吗？机会近在眼前。北京大学国际法学院（STL）2026研究生招生系列活动即将开启，我们诚挚邀请计划申请或报考的同学及家长积极参与，零距离感受STL的独特魅力，深入了解STL的办学理念、培养目标和师资力量。</p><p>北京大学国际法学院2026研究生招生首场活动定于<strong>4月12日（周六）</strong>在<strong>深圳</strong>举行，这是一次全方位认识STL、与师生交流的难得机会。名额有限，感兴趣的同学请尽快完成报名，活动流程和阅读材料后续将通过邮件发送给成功报名者。</p><p>此外，为方便全国各地的考生及家长了解STL及其培养项目，学院还将在北京、上海、成都、武汉、广州等城市举办专场招生宣讲会。最新活动信息将通过学院官方网站和微信公众号持续更新。</p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2026研究生招生开放日</span></strong></p><p><strong>活动日期：</strong><span>2025年4月12日（周六）全天</span><br/></p><p><strong>报名时间：</strong>即日起至4月8日（周二）中午12:00</p><p><strong>活动地点：</strong>北京大学深圳研究生院国际法学院大楼</p><p><strong>活动日程：</strong>校园参观、学院介绍、课程体验、互动交流等</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nibseVDIzCmdE2AGaibYF2Zu6r617ibU9iafKoySEzNHEQQ9IiaSfdHdBBKA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>报名方式</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p>请扫描下列二维码报名<br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nAWEgZnOV6Zj0icQp0tTicbb9rAPDCvaxt9xnZPcCs55TRChGGplQjv4Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nibseVDIzCmdE2AGaibYF2Zu6r617ibU9iafKoySEzNHEQQ9IiaSfdHdBBKA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>联系方式</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p>我院招生办公室提供多种形式的咨询服务，若对报考或申请有任何疑问，可通过以下方式咨询：</p><p>1、邮件咨询</p><p>关于保研或考研的问题，可发送至admission@stl.pku.edu.cn 邮箱；</p><p>关于夏令营的问题，可发送至shp@stl.pku.edu.cn 邮箱。</p><p>2、电话咨询</p><p>请在工作时间拨打0755-26032287或0755-26035339进行电话咨询。</p><p>工作时间：周一至周五上午8:00-12:00，下午1:30-5:30。</p><p>3、群内咨询</p><p>请扫描下列二维码加入最新保研或考研群，申请进群和进群后请备注“个人姓名-本科年级-本科专业。”</p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nbfu44WW288V6UXaKba55960h8JQKoIrSncs52Ir4CmIEQMSNrT1CCA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nDmy8eh4Qea2DrU31qeY1NEOSqZc3V8iaEw8ab0D5icF3oLTzeoicwkxVg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nJIbbOL6K9jzuYyk4owFnxrXrVKaGxFMYfwhicLCcDz0S9flyUChVuvw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nUgl6ebINP9Irrx9u6am5WUKCaFAuC8YJohBGayiaGm8RfcS3VGhrKKQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nqvQWETF6qnANEKlIPgPDwPDrVnH2e9E2Yftn5CPSVK7Mkt32WRamuw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iclxD2esxZq8tuvsT5HLVnyxfIcmib713nZehcSctlGMiabf5EAN2Sxn4VRU4OBbvoKxv0gia8PKCg51NPzKXbOxOA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><br/></section></section></section></section></section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>推荐阅读</span><br/></p></section></section></section><section><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3OTE0MjQzMw==&amp;mid=2651967491&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5cb747e6a8b58084852f918a3c5f068c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">北大国际法学院，15岁！</a><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NjQ2